{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"b736d86cad08e184","type":"group","x":1360,"y":200,"width":935,"height":480,"color":"#9163b0","label":"Rezero Puzzle"},
		{"id":"b3ebabfa2111b307","type":"group","x":640,"y":220,"width":590,"height":508,"color":"#90923a","label":"Treasure/Monster Hunt"},
		{"id":"c1af896d18c0888b","type":"group","x":2440,"y":267,"width":478,"height":346,"color":"#e67070","label":"Sacrifice"},
		{"id":"8f26f9105330faff","type":"text","text":"There is a set location the players are in. There is some event that always happens that kills everyone there. The party somehow goes back in time and gets another chance to solve the mystery and stop everyone from dying.","x":1554,"y":220,"width":394,"height":152,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"e8dc8c30e49f2ca4","type":"text","text":"Puzzle","x":1698,"y":44,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"597070d0db02986c","type":"text","text":"Escort Quest","x":2440,"y":74,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"f4b48209369f16e3","type":"text","text":"The church hires the party to escort X girls to defeat the Demon Lord","x":2460,"y":287,"width":438,"height":89,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"782bcd97305a9f4a","type":"text","text":"Hard to explain away why party not here","x":2460,"y":417,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b79640625073821d","type":"text","text":"Bonds that need to be established with certain players won't be there. ","x":2460,"y":519,"width":351,"height":74,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"23adc809796cb841","type":"text","text":"Not flexible with changing amounts of players","x":2340,"y":-311,"width":320,"height":64,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"82216d9498bedd25","type":"text","text":"One way to make this work is that each time the party signs off, is the summon time limit?","x":2710,"y":-332,"width":270,"height":106,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"93c746c6feb50032","type":"text","text":"The party gets summoned into a new world. They are in the king's chambers. All the nobles, soldiers, mages, and advisors are there. As the heroes gets summon, there is dust around them that gets kicked up as the summon finishes. The King's announcer(?) says in a booming voice \"Welcome to the kingdom of []. I apologize for being taken so abruptly from your world, but please help us fight back against...\". Right then, the dust settlings and the party of X is reveal. Everyone goes silent and panic ensues. The reason being is that the stronger the coming threat is, the more heroes are summoned. And this is the highest recorded amount","x":1722,"y":-423,"width":574,"height":288,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"f293b055e2f91be1","type":"text","text":"If someone has an idea, they might be able to execute it next session","x":1380,"y":573,"width":298,"height":87,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d5b6feb651e64a1e","type":"text","text":"Some players who are invested might miss out on stuff","x":1394,"y":440,"width":270,"height":80,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"530f9974a40fa11d","type":"text","text":"Too bad, so sad","x":1698,"y":548,"width":250,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"34d8c51de9b26440","type":"text","text":"Party Flexible. Not reliant on who is there that day since progress always moves forward.","x":1974,"y":520,"width":301,"height":107,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"419d12fc3700829b","type":"text","text":"# **Idea Board**\n","x":1210,"y":-720,"width":296,"height":82,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b782cf8dee2b7a90","type":"text","text":"Earn rewards","x":960,"y":506,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"aaef5a5b45caff0c","type":"text","text":"Monster Hunt","x":878,"y":19,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"5f8de13e7ab6cc71","type":"text","text":"There is a competition between all the Travelers. They compete to hunt the biggest and strongest creatures. Think like wuxia treasure realm opening. There will be alliances, backstabbing, etc.","x":738,"y":240,"width":382,"height":156,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"b1baca414faf4d8d","type":"text","text":"Only player who participate that day will be able to get new rewards","x":660,"y":482,"width":269,"height":108,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"1eedb60c0322f319","type":"text","text":"Oh well","x":669,"y":648,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a30ca6bdec746bce","type":"text","text":"Enemies","x":85,"y":114,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d922ca905e67273b","type":"text","text":"Encounter other Travelers","x":-137,"y":-80,"width":257,"height":80,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"579e752a564beb85","type":"text","text":"Friends","x":-186,"y":116,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"45125a781b9b5789","type":"text","text":"# Goals","x":-275,"y":-320,"width":250,"height":82,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cab00a2b8ae550e8","type":"text","text":"Shopkeeper","x":-525,"y":144,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a6a6156ae10d87da","type":"text","text":"Mentor Figure","x":-525,"y":296,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e463fe4c239ec600","type":"text","text":"Someone to be a permeant member of the Dark Room.","x":-744,"y":-80,"width":344,"height":80,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"42dc260465509a87","type":"text","text":"Blacksmith","x":-869,"y":144,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
